=\"1115\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/131cd811-8e86-4787-baf3-2847dff949fa\" />\r\n\r\nBut the behaviour in a running instance of a game is the same and correct for both this PR and 4.4.1:\r\n\r\nThis PR Debanding OFF (Game) | This PR Debanding ON (Game)\r\n-- | --\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18ba3cce-6aae-41b7-9355-718cb0ca1146\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3338fc6d-af8c-4263-9ecc-4a6a9bd34ffa\" />\r\n\r\n4.4.1 Debanding OFF (Game) | 4.4.1 Debanding ON (Game)\r\n-- | --\r\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3078b30d-ff75-483d-919e-e11f1ab6ea21\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/801a43a5-760b-48cf-8cc3-0f80e35bdd8a\" />\r\n\r\nSo on my side, everything is working correctly and as expected in this PR's build artifact and I can't reproduce the issue you've described... 🤔 (Well, except for needing to restart the editor... but I remember this being an existing issue in 4.4.1.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3114293066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3114391473","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108761#issuecomment-3114391473","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108761","id":3114391473,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65odex","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://g